status: accept
exit: 0
covers: program top_decl
note: |
  Form A/D. An empty `place Entry { }` marker at the project root plus a
  top-level `fun main`. This is the dominant form in all 34 examples/ projects
  (measured 2026-07-02); the canonical fixture is that shape promoted to spec,
  not invented. `place Entry` is the entrypoint marker; `main` is an ordinary
  top-level function beside it.
